Package: cqtcpower
Type: Package
Title: Power and Sample Size for Concentration-QTc Analyses in Parallel Single
    Ascending Dose Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tony", "Hu", email = "tonyhu1994@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Analytical and simulation-based power and sample size calculations
    for concentration-QTc (C-QTc) analyses of parallel-group single ascending
    dose (SAD) studies analysed with linear mixed-effects models. Closed-form
    approximations of the covariance of the treatment and concentration effects
    are provided for random-intercept and uncorrelated random-slope models, with
    and without a treatment indicator. A simulation engine based on 'lme4' and
    'lmerTest' covers all six models, including the correlated random-slope
    models, and reports empirical power, coverage probability and relative bias
    with Wald, Satterthwaite or Kenward-Roger degrees of freedom.
